menu "Math"

    config MATH_FPU_RECIP
        bool "Use FPU reciprocal seeds"
        default y
        help
            Use the ESP32-S3 FPU recip0.s and rsqrt0.s seeds. Disable where
            the emulator lacks these instructions (Espressif QEMU).

    config MATH_FPU_FUSED_MADD
        bool "Use FPU fused multiply-add"
        default y
        help
            Rely on madd.s/msub.s rounding once. Disable where the emulator
            rounds the product (Espressif QEMU).

    config MATH_COUNT_CALLS
        bool "Count math fast-path calls by translation unit"
        default n
        help
            Attribute calls to the calling translation unit during measured
            render windows. Counts are diagnostic instrumentation and add
            atomic operations to each annotated call.

endmenu
